      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A tall, gaunt fey wrapped in wings like a shroud of smoke. Its face is smooth and eyeless, with a thin mouth that never opens. Black claws rest on its chest. A silver circlet sits on its brow, marking its rank.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.Re1E5HNvjVn5pPMC]{14. The Shadow Court}.</strong> Ankou assassin who runs the audience through Telepathy and the Influence target. If it becomes a fight, it uses Shadow Doubles for three actions at once.</p>"
    },
